# FlintTrade — design-system

This package contains reusable UI assets for FlintTrade applications.

## Scope
- Shared tokens, CSS layers, brand primitives, density-aware components, and form helpers.
- Terminal and site may import from `@flinttrade/design-system`.
- Application shells, routes, Dockview panels, and trading widgets stay in their app packages.

## Checks
- Run the consuming app typechecks/builds after changing public exports.
- Verify no inline style/CSP regressions are introduced.
